      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-03T00:16:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh.&nbsp; Never heard of it.&nbsp; Wonder if they intentionally rigged their acronym to farm Google searches or the like....</p><p>On a vaguely related topic, someone showed off a new deckbuilding Kickstarter game the other night, and I didn't quite catch the name (I want to say it was Heroes of Metro City or something close to that).&nbsp; Sounded interesting, but the game had no art so I couldn't quite bring myself to care...but the concept was supposed to be that, instead of building a deck of full of existing superheroes, you build a deck which represents a single original superhero, and I found that concept quite appealing.</p>",
