      "created_at": "2014-02-03T14:18:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heh, no, we just came up with a name we really liked, used it a bunch, and then wrote down the acronym and went, \"Oh. Hell.\"<br><br>But by that time we were already very attached to the name. It fits. It's good. And it's not like we use the acronym of the name of expansion in an official in game or business way.&nbsp;</p><p>No underhanded intent here!</p><p>At least, not with the name of that expansion...</p>",
