      "raw": "[quote=\"Christopher\"]\n\nHeh, no, we just came up with a name we really liked, used it a bunch, and then wrote down the acronym and went, &quot;Oh. Hell.&quot;But by that time we were already very attached to the name. It fits. It&#39;s good. And it&#39;s not like we use the acronym of the name of expansion in an official in game or business way.&nbsp;No underhanded intent here!At least, not with the name of that expansion...\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe funny part to me is that using just the first name &quot;Wrath&quot; doesn&#39;t really work for me and my friends either, because we played WoW, and that was shorthand for the Wrath of the Lich King expansion, so we&#39;re probably just gunna end up calling it &quot;cosmos&quot;\n",
